# Launch module guide · launch-source-layout/1
# @launch-guide
# Main arrangement

Decision case "LAUNCH-EXAMPLE-01" named "Can this first shipment proceed?".
Review has property "schemaVersion" = 1.
Review has property "model" = "contextual-review/1.0".
Objective "Prepare first-shipment decision".
Step "Select shipment package".
"Prepare first-shipment decision" requires all of "Select shipment package".
Candidate "ARR-A".
Candidate "ARR-B".
Candidate "ARR-C".
Candidate "ARR-D".
"Select shipment package" requires one of "ARR-A", "ARR-B", "ARR-C", "ARR-D".

